#!/bin/sh
# 提交闸门：源码/测试/工具改了，但没有对应的落盘记录（当日 journal 或 CHANGES.md）→ 拒绝提交。
# 安装：git config core.hooksPath .githooks
# 绕过（不推荐）：git commit --no-verify
set -u
ROOT_DIR="$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null)" || exit 0
cd "$ROOT_DIR" || exit 0

PY=""
for cand in python python3 py ./.venv/Scripts/python.exe ./.venv/bin/python; do
  if command -v "$cand" >/dev/null 2>&1; then PY="$cand"; break; fi
done
if [ -z "$PY" ]; then
  echo "[pre-commit] 未找到 python，跳过落盘闸门"
  exit 0
fi

if "$PY" tools/journal_sync.py --check; then
  exit 0
fi

echo ""
echo "[pre-commit] 落盘闸门未通过：源码改动缺少对应记录。"
echo "  1) $PY tools/journal_sync.py          # 生成当日 journal 草稿，并补齐 决策/验证/遗留"
echo "  2) $PY tools/journal_sync.py --state  # 刷新 docs/STATE.md 的现状与下一步"
echo "  3) 或更新 CHANGES.md 的批次条目"
echo "  确认无需记录时可用：git commit --no-verify"
exit 1
